            <h2>Why Shortify Exists</h2>
            <p>We created Shortify with one simple idea: sharing links should be effortless. Long URLs can look messy, take up unnecessary space, and become difficult to manage. Shortify brings everything together in one simple place, helping people create shorter links and understand how those links are being used.</p>
